@startuml UC15_RequestAssistance
autonumber

actor "Passenger" as Passenger
participant "System" as Sys
actor "Ground Manager" as GroundManager
actor "Ground Staff" as GroundStaff

Passenger -> Sys : Request additional assistance
Sys -> Passenger : Ask to specify needs
Passenger -> Sys : Submit assistance details
Sys -> GroundManager : Notify assistance request
GroundManager -> GroundStaff : Assign assistance task
Sys -> GroundStaff : Notify task details
Sys -> Passenger : Display confirmation message

@enduml